(7675804, 1254316, 251422, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by VitaminB:</b></div><hr/><i> Any chance you''d be willing to do a tutorial on this? Awesome shot. </i></td></tr></table>This photo was originally flowers taken on a light table.  There were 9 shots that were combined in PS. Then I did a LAB inversion and then put it through several different PS processes that I will have to look up.  I''ll send to you once I find it again. Thanks  Susan<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by VitaminB: Any chance you''d be willing to do a tutorial on this? Awesome shot. This photo was originally flowers taken on a light table.  There were 9 shots that were combined in PS. Then I did a LAB inversion and then put it through several different PS processes that I will have to look up.  I''ll send to you once I find it again. Thanks  Susan', '2020-10-02 21:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
