(7675830, 1254258, 24454, '<td valign="top">Its hard to believe its not one of your amazing insect photos.  The voters are so unpredictable.  For me, it seems the more I THINK a photo is going to do great, the more likely it is to see the voters go, Meh... take this 5 or 4, haha!<br/> <br/>Not too long ago, I was looking back at old challenges and it seemed every challenge got tons and tons iof comments and tons and tons of votes!   It made it easier for the few who like to vote down photos at the end not change things much.  Now, like here, with only 39 votes.... it only takes a couple who do that to ruin an overall score!  In my last challenge, I went from a 7.00 to a 6.5 in 4 votes!!   I guess its just something we have to live with... and not place too much importance on the scores.  Its hard I know, because we want to win or at least do good...  but for me, its been good to learn to do my best, and be proud of what I enter, then not let the end result get to me too much.  Art is so subjective!  And with only 39 people weighing in, it really means nothing as to the quality of the art!   Thats my 2-cents anyway.</td>', 'Its hard to believe its not one of your amazing insect photos.  The voters are so unpredictable.  For me, it seems the more I THINK a photo is going to do great, the more likely it is to see the voters go, Meh... take this 5 or 4, haha! Not too long ago, I was looking back at old challenges and it seemed every challenge got tons and tons iof comments and tons and tons of votes!   It made it easier for the few who like to vote down photos at the end not change things much.  Now, like here, with only 39 votes.... it only takes a couple who do that to ruin an overall score!  In my last challenge, I went from a 7.00 to a 6.5 in 4 votes!!   I guess its just something we have to live with... and not place too much importance on the scores.  Its hard I know, because we want to win or at least do good...  but for me, its been good to learn to do my best, and be proud of what I enter, then not let the end result get to me too much.  Art is so subjective!  And with only 39 people weighing in, it really means nothing as to the quality of the art!   Thats my 2-cents anyway.', '2020-10-03 12:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7675838, 1254337, 86447, '<td valign="top">Im so glad this ribboned!</td>', 'Im so glad this ribboned!', '2020-10-03 16:23:26.000000', NULL, 0);
